  message: "Closed in PR merging 75a9349ee5 (2026-05-21). Two fixes: (1) entrypoints.py falls back to sym.meta http_method/route_path when concept dict lacks them (Rails framework_role-based route shape); (2) _method_basename strips both . and # separators (Ruby Class#method). Empirical on chatwoot: HTTP_ROUTE 1->115; reachable 446->1183; dead_percent 96.7%->91.2%. demoted_dispatch_inherited still 0 on chatwoot — separate Ruby call-graph completeness gap (Klass.new->#initialize, before_action callback targets not modeled)."  # 9d5c
